            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-27T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-28T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-26T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-27T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning. Winds east to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to around 9 with daytime temperatures reaching around 15.</text>
