            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-28T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-29T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-27T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-28T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds easterly 20 to 30 km/h turning northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
