            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-29T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-30T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-28T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-29T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers in the evening. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h increasing to 35 km/h before shifting westerly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid 20s.</text>
